WEBVTT

00:00:00.009 --> 00:00:04.662
An L L M adds uncertainty, latency, cost, and a larger security surface.

00:00:04.662 --> 00:00:12.067
Exact calculations are often better handled by deterministic code, simple lookups by a database,

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:18.032
and fixed business rules by normal validation logic.

00:00:18.032 --> 00:00:24.702
Use an L L M when flexible language understanding or generation creates real value.

00:00:24.702 --> 00:00:32.022
Choosing not to use an L L M can be a strong engineering decision when deterministic software solves the problem more

00:00:32.022 --> 00:00:33.528
reliably.
